{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10367","headline":"宴韦司户山亭院 · 高适","name":"宴韦司户山亭院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人幽想灵山，意惬怜远水。\n习静务爲适，所居还复尔。\n汲流涨华池，开酌宴君子。\n苔迳试窥践，石屏可攀倚。\n入门见中峰，携手如万里。\n横琴了无事，垂钓应有以。\n高馆何沈沈，飒然凉风起。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10367.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10367","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}